2026-07-27T07:47:41.5037298Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5038018Z i /tmp/RtmpByEpU3/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5038434Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5038891Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5039623Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5040247Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5041255Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5041972Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5261493Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5369208Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5770312Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:47:41.5928313Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
